{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on Atrea\u2019s journey, a princess who gets her mind swapped with a minotaur! A puzzle fighter RPG where your choices shape your fate. Duel your friends in multiplayer mode. Talk or fight your way through +100 levels to reclaim your throne in a combination of turn-based and real-time gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1885400/extras/8db458e31db1e0e6bf24289dcddb8d75.avif?t=1737671452\" width=605 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1885400/extras/da527840a4a60d3fc6082bca394b5427.poster.avif?t=1737671452\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1885400/extras/da527840a4a60d3fc6082bca394b5427.webm?t=1737671452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1885400/extras/da527840a4a60d3fc6082bca394b5427.mp4?t=1737671452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Match pieces to perform powerful moves! A better combination could mean the difference between a fireball and a meteor!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1885400/extras/5f61d1abf8980eaa26199719995febcc.avif?t=1737671452\" width=605 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1885400/extras/66b764f3b04b21133e0d4e6a0ebd9e09.poster.avif?t=1737671452\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/